 In addition, the company engages in the rental of investment properties, including warehouses, factories, commercial buildings, shop offices, retail lots, serviced apartments and land. The company was formerly known as Dynaciate Group Berhad and changed its name to Ingenieur Gudang Berhad in July 2022. Ingenieur Gudang Berhad is based in Subang Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Ingenieur Gudang Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事建筑业务，总部位于马来西亚 Subang Jaya。公司前身为 Dynaciate Group Berhad，于 2022 年 7 月更名为现名。公司通过物业投资及其他、建筑两个部门运营。","lines":["基础设施建设：设计、规划、建设和管理道路、隧道、桥梁、设施、建筑及其他项目，以及临时施工设施、生产和管理建筑、仓库和车间。","工程与安装服务：承接土木与机械工程、建筑工程、钢结构制造和安装工作。","物业租赁：出租投资物业，包括仓库、工厂、商业建筑、店铺办公室、零售单位、服务式公寓和土地。"],"lines_en":["Infrastructure Construction: Design, planning, construction, and management of roads, tunnels, bridges, facilities, buildings, and other projects, as well as temporary construction facilities, production and administration buildings, warehouses, and workshops.","Engineering and Installation Services: Civil and mechanical engineering, architectural, steel fabrication, and installation works.","Property Rental: Rental of investment properties, including warehouses, factories, commercial buildings, shop offices, retail lots, serviced apartments, and land."]}}